"Reset grant…" = "重置授权…";
"Couldn't change the login item" = "无法更改登录项";
"Launch at login only works when CalmMouse runs from an app bundle (e.g. /Applications)." = "只有当 CalmMouse 从 App 包（如 /Applications）运行时，“登录时启动”才可用。";

