"CalmMouse %@ is available." = "CalmMouse %@ 已发布。";
"Update Now" = "立即更新";
"Full release notes ›" = "完整更新说明 ›";
"Downloading…" = "正在下载…";
"Installing — CalmMouse will relaunch itself in a moment." = "正在安装——CalmMouse 稍后会自动重新启动。";
"Download from the website instead ›" = "改从网站下载 ›";
"Couldn't read the releases feed." = "无法读取发布源。";
"This release has no download attached — grab it from the website." = "此版本没有附带下载文件——请从网站获取。";
"Download failed." = "下载失败。";
