/* Presets tab */
"Preset name" = "预置名称";
"Use" = "使用";
"Delete this preset" = "删除此预置";

/* Built-in presets (defined in CalmMouseCore, translated at display time) */
"Just fix clicking" = "只修好点按";
"Pages hold still while you click.\nNothing else changes." = "点按时页面保持不动。\n其他一切不变。";
"Extra steady" = "格外稳定";
"Ignores nudges and diagonal drift.\nThe page stops when your finger does." = "忽略轻微触碰和斜向偏移。\n手指一停页面就停。";
"Trackpad feel" = "触控板手感";
"Tap to click and right-click.\nDouble Tap Drag to move things." = "轻点来点按和右键点按。\n轻点两下拖移来移动对象。";

/* Scrolling tab */
"The page stays put while you click." = "点按时页面保持不动。";
"Hold still after you let go" = "松开后稍作停顿";
"A short pause after you let go,\nso a lifting finger can't scroll." = "松开后稍作停顿，\n抬起手指时不会带动页面。";
"Off" = "关";
"Ignore small finger nudges" = "忽略手指的轻微触碰";
"Scrolling waits for this much travel.\nA resting finger can't move the page." = "滑动超过这段距离才开始滚动。\n搭着的手指不会带动页面。";
"A swipe that drifts stays straight." = "轻扫略有偏斜也能走直线。";
"Lock direction after sliding" = "滑动多远后锁定方向";
"How far a swipe goes before it locks." = "滑动多远后锁定方向。";
"On: the page glides after a swipe.\nOff: it stops when your finger does." = "开：轻扫后页面继续滑动。\n关：手指一停页面就停。";
"Ignore sideways scrolling" = "忽略横向滚动";
"Sideways swipes do nothing." = "横向轻扫不起作用。";

/* Clicking tab */
"A light tap clicks.\nPressing the mouse still works." = "轻轻一点即点按。\n按下鼠标依然有效。";
"Firm: only quick, deliberate taps.\nLight: gentler, slower taps too." = "重：只有快速、有意的轻点。\n轻：轻柔、较慢的轻点也算。";
"Firm" = "重";
"Light" = "轻";
"Tap to right-click" = "轻点来右键点按";
"Tap twice quickly to right-click.\nPress the mouse to double-click." = "快速轻点两下来右键点按。\n连按请按下鼠标。";
"Tap the right side to right-click.\nTaps elsewhere are normal clicks." = "轻点右侧来右键点按。\n其他位置仍是普通点按。";
"A tap on the right side" = "轻点右侧";
"A double-tap" = "连续轻点两下";
"Front of the mouse only" = "仅鼠标前部";
"Only taps near the front count.\nYour grip can't click by accident." = "只有靠近前端的轻点才算数。\n握持的手指不会误触。";
"Size of the tap area" = "轻点区域大小";
"Double Tap Drag" = "轻点两下拖移";
"Tap twice and leave your finger down.\nMove the mouse right away to drag.\nLift your finger to drop." = "轻点两下，第二下手指不抬起。\n马上移动鼠标开始拖移。\n抬起手指即放下。";
"Use the left or middle of the mouse." = "请使用鼠标的左侧或中间。";
"Two-finger drag" = "双指拖移";
"Rest two fingers and hold a moment.\nMove the mouse to drag.\nLift your fingers to drop." = "两指放上并停留片刻。\n移动鼠标开始拖移。\n抬起手指即放下。";

/* Apps tab */
"Rule enabled" = "启用规则";
"Ignore Magic Mouse scrolling" = "忽略妙控鼠标滚动";
"Default" = "默认";
"On" = "开";

/* Shortcuts tab */
"While holding %@" = "按住 %@ 时";
"Hold a key while you scroll\nto do the action you picked." = "滚动时按住按键，\n可以执行你选择的操作。";
"Scroll normally" = "正常滚动";
"Scroll sideways" = "横向滚动";
"Scroll in reverse" = "反向滚动";
"Zoom in apps" = "在 App 中缩放";
"Zoom the whole screen" = "缩放整个屏幕";
"Do nothing" = "不执行任何操作";

/* Battery tab */
"Magic Mouse" = "妙控鼠标";
"Low battery warning" = "低电量警告";

/* Onboarding */
"Welcome to CalmMouse" = "欢迎使用 CalmMouse";
"Your Magic Mouse's whole top is a touch surface — and it stays live while you click, so pages jump around. CalmMouse fixes that." = "妙控鼠标的整个顶面都是触控表面——而且在点按时依然生效，所以页面总是乱跳。CalmMouse 解决这个问题。";
"The page holds still while you click. That's the main fix — the next steps set it up." = "点按时页面保持不动。这就是核心修复——接下来几步完成设置。";
"Allow CalmMouse to see mouse events" = "允许 CalmMouse 看到鼠标事件";
"macOS calls this Accessibility access. It's how CalmMouse can tell a click from a scroll — it never sees keystrokes and never touches the network." = "macOS 称之为辅助功能权限。CalmMouse 靠它分辨点按和滚动——它不会看到键盘输入，也从不联网。";
"Access granted — you're all set." = "已授权——一切就绪。";
"Turn on CalmMouse in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility." = "在系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能中打开 CalmMouse。";
"Open System Settings…" = "打开系统设置…";
"You can also do this later — CalmMouse waits in the menu bar and starts working within two seconds of being allowed." = "也可以稍后再做——CalmMouse 会在菜单栏等着，授权后两秒内开始工作。";
"Pick a starting point" = "选择一个起点";
"One click sets everything up. You can tweak any single setting afterwards — and save your own presets in Settings → Magic Mouse." = "一键完成全部设置。之后可以单独调整任何选项——还能在设置 → 妙控鼠标中存储自己的预置。";
"Try it" = "试一试";
"Grab your Magic Mouse and put the cursor over any page you can scroll — this window's background works too." = "拿起妙控鼠标，把光标放在任何可滚动的页面上——这个窗口的背景也可以。";
"Click and hold the mouse button." = "按住鼠标按键不放。";
"Slide your finger along the surface, like a scroll." = "手指沿表面滑动，就像滚动一样。";
"The page stays put — that scroll was swallowed." = "页面纹丝不动——那次滚动被拦下了。";
"Also try a light tap — no press needed. That's tap to click." = "再试试轻轻一点——无需按压。这就是轻点来点按。";
"Accessibility access isn't granted yet, so nothing is blocked. Go back one step to turn it on." = "尚未授予辅助功能权限，所以什么都不会被拦截。返回上一步打开它。";
"It works! **1** accidental scroll calmed just now." = "起作用了！刚刚安抚了 **1** 次误滚动。";
"It works! **%ld** accidental scrolls calmed just now." = "起作用了！刚刚安抚了 **%ld** 次误滚动。";
"Waiting for a click-and-slide on the Magic Mouse…" = "等待在妙控鼠标上按住并滑动…";
"That's it" = "完成了";
"CalmMouse lives in your menu bar and keeps working in the background." = "CalmMouse 常驻菜单栏，在后台持续工作。";
"Look for the mouse icon in the menu bar — the everyday switches live there. Orange means it needs attention, dimmed means paused." = "在菜单栏找到鼠标图标——常用开关都在那里。橙色表示需要处理，变暗表示已暂停。";
"In Settings, hover any option for a little animated preview of what it does." = "在设置中，将指针悬停在任意选项上，就能看到演示其效果的小动画。";
"Changed your mind about the feel? Settings → Magic Mouse switches the whole setup in one click, or saves your own." = "想换种手感？设置 → 妙控鼠标可以一键切换整套设置，也能存储你自己的预置。";
"Back" = "返回";
"Continue" = "继续";
"Start Using CalmMouse" = "开始使用 CalmMouse";

